    <p>By Graeme and Stephen Scott &copy; 1994-2026. <br />
        WIMP front end by <a href="https://drwimp.archivemag.co.uk/" target="_blank">Dr Wimp 5.04</a>.</p>
    <p>This game is dedicated to Mary Scott (1944 - 2010), who always enjoyed playing JCB Digger, Spectapede, Strike
        Force Harrier, and many other games, too numerous to mention. A wonderful mum, sadly missed.</p>
